cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
type: software
title: "tididi-cnf: a knowledge compiler and model counter for CNF"
abstract: "A knowledge compiler and model counter for CNF: it compiles DIMACS formulas into Tree Decision Diagrams, canonical vtree-shaped decision diagrams, and counts their models: plain, weighted, projected, and projected weighted."
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Tractables/tididi-cnf"
